) -> Decimal:
    """Return the order discount rate: the VIP tier rate plus the coupon rate, if any.

    A coupon only contributes its rate when the order subtotal meets the coupon's
    ``min_subtotal`` threshold (RULE-003). Coupons without a ``min_subtotal`` key
    impose no minimum.
